{"id":"H7065","lemma":"קָנָא","transliteration":"qana","sayIt":"qa-NA","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"verb","gloss":"be jealous","meaning":"1) to envy, be jealous, be envious, be zealous\n1a) (Piel)\n1a1) to be jealous of\n1a2) to be envious of\n1a3) to be zealous for\n1a4) to excite to jealous anger\n1b) (Hiphil) to provoke to jealous anger, cause jealousy","glosses":["envy","envied","jealous","suspects","zealous","provoked his jealousy"],"count":29,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-26","v":14,"renderings":{"bsb":"him"}},{"chapterId":"gen-30","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"she envied","kjv":"envied"}},{"chapterId":"gen-37","v":11,"renderings":{"bsb":"were jealous","kjv":"envied"}},{"chapterId":"num-5","v":14,"renderings":{"bsb":"and he suspects","kjv":"and he be jealous"}},{"chapterId":"num-5","v":30,"renderings":{"bsb":"and he suspects","kjv":"and he be jealous"}},{"chapterId":"num-11","v":29,"renderings":{"bsb":"on","kjv":"Enviest"}},{"chapterId":"num-25","v":11,"renderings":{"bsb":"for he was zealous","kjv":"while he was zealous"}},{"chapterId":"num-25","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"he was zealous","kjv":"he was zealous"}},{"chapterId":"deu-32","v":16,"renderings":{"bsb":"They provoked His jealousy","kjv":"They provoked him to jealousy"}},{"chapterId":"deu-32","v":21,"renderings":{"bsb":"have provoked My jealousy","kjv":"They have moved me to jealousy"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-21","v":2,"renderings":{"bsb":"but in his zeal","kjv":"them in his zeal"}},{"chapterId":"1ki-14","v":22,"renderings":{"bsb":"they provoked Him to jealous anger","kjv":"and they provoked him to jealousy"}},{"chapterId":"1ki-19","v":10,"renderings":{"bsb":"I have been very zealous","kjv":"I have been very"}},{"chapterId":"1ki-19","v":14,"renderings":{"bsb":"I have been very zealous","kjv":"I have been very"}},{"chapterId":"psa-37","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"envy","kjv":"neither be thou envious"}},{"chapterId":"psa-73","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"I envied","kjv":"For I was envious"}},{"chapterId":"ps